{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1CO","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"哥林多前书","commonName":"哥林多前书","title":"哥林多前书","order":46,"numberOfChapters":16,"sha256":"3ea536a95e4975b8ebe77976cde16baab162baac7648d81845fd421e8b0ad812","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":16,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CO/16.json","totalNumberOfVerses":437},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["信仰的基础"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["弟兄姊妹，我当初到你们那里传扬上帝的奥秘，并没有用高言大智。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["因为我已决定在你们当中不谈别的，只谈耶稣基督和祂被钉十字架的事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["那时我在你们当中很软弱，害怕，战战兢兢。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我说话、讲道不是靠充满智慧的雄辩之词，而是靠圣灵的能力作明证，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["好使你们的信仰不是以人的智慧为基础，而是以上帝的能力为基础。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["当然我们也跟成熟的人谈论智慧，不过并非这个世代的智慧，也不是那些在世上当权、将要衰亡之人的智慧。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我们所讲的是上帝隐藏在奥秘中的智慧，是祂为了使我们得荣耀而在万世以前定好的智慧。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["只可惜世上当权的人没有一个明白这智慧。他们要是明白，就不会把荣耀的主钉在十字架上了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["正如圣经上说：",{"text":"“上帝为爱祂的人所预备的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是眼睛未曾见过，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耳朵未曾听闻，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人心也未曾想到的。”","poem":1},{"noteId":3}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["然而，上帝借着圣灵将这一切启示给我们，因为圣灵洞悉万事，连上帝深奥的事都了如指掌。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["除了人里面的灵，谁能了解人的事呢？照样，除了上帝的灵，谁也不能了解上帝的事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我们接受的不是这世界的灵，而是上帝的灵，使我们可以领会上帝慷慨赐给我们的一切。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["我们讲述这些事，不是用人类智慧所教的话，而是用圣灵所教的话，用属灵的话解释属灵的事",{"noteId":4},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["然而，属血气的人不接受从上帝的灵而来的教导，认为愚不可及，无法明白，因为只有属灵的人才能参透。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["属灵的人能够参透万事，但没有人能参透他。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"text":"“谁曾知道主的心意，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"能够指教祂呢？”","poem":1},{"noteId":5},"但我们明白基督的心意。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":3,"caller":"+","text":"以赛亚书64:4。","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":9}},{"noteId":4,"caller":"+","text":"“用属灵的话解释属灵的事”或译“向属灵的人解释属灵的事”。","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":13}},{"noteId":5,"caller":"+","text":"以赛亚书40:13。","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":16}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CO/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CO/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CO/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}